---
---
<footer class="bg-brand-soft-pink/40 border-t border-brand-peach/15 pt-16 pb-12 mt-auto">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8 mb-12">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Logo & Tagline -->
    <div class="text-center md:text-left">
      <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 group justify-center md:justify-start mb-4">
        <img src="/images/app-logo.png" alt="Luna y Brillo" class="w-9 h-9 object-contain rounded-xl hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 shadow-3xs" />
        <span class="font-display font-extrabold text-lg tracking-wide text-brand-peach">Luna y Brillo</span>
      </a>
      <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-medium max-w-sm leading-relaxed">
        Tu diario móvil de autocuidado. Hecho con amor para acompañarte y consentirte en tu ciclo menstrual, cronograma capilar y rutina de skincare.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Heartwarming reminder -->
    <div class="text-center md:text-right">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/70 border border-brand-peach/10 text-[10px] text-brand-peach font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        <span>💌 Recordatorio Diario</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs italic text-stone-500 font-medium">
        "Recuerda brillar con tu propia luz, hoy y siempre."
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Copyright and Tech Stack Credits -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 pt-8 border-t border-brand-peach/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-semibold tracking-wide">
    <p>
      &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Luna y Brillo. Todos los derechos reservados.
    </p>
    
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
      <span>Creado con el</span>
      <span class="text-rose-400">💖</span>
      <span>y desarrollado por Tatiana Anacona</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</footer>
